push([1,\"{\\\"@context\\\":\\\"https://schema.org\\\",\\\"@type\\\":\\\"BlogPosting\\\",\\\"headline\\\":\\\"Animal Names Inspired by Fantasy: 200+ Magical \\u0026 Mythical Ideas 🧙\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"Step into realms of magic. Discover fantasy-inspired animal names from beloved books, games, and imagined worlds. Perfect for pets with enchanting personalities.\\\",\\\"datePublished\\\":\\\"2026-06-18\\\",\\\"dateModified\\\":\\\"2026-07-06\\\",\\\"author\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Organization\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"BestAnimalNames Editorial Team\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://bestanimalnames.com/about/\\\"},\\\"publisher\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Organization\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"BestAnimalNames\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://bestanimalnames.com\\\"},\\\"mainEntityOfPage\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"WebPage\\\",\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https://bestanimalnames.com/blog/animal-names-inspired-by-fantasy/\\\"},\\\"wordCount\\\":110,\\\"articleBody\\\":\\\" Fantasy worlds have given us some of the most evocative names in literature. From Middle-earth to Hogwarts, from Narnia to Westeros, fantasy names carry magic, power, and wonder. Dragon \\u0026 Magical Beast Names \\u003cstrong\\u003eSmaug\\u003c/strong\\u003e, \\u003cstrong\\u003eDrogon\\u003c/strong\\u003e, \\u003cstrong\\u003eToothless\\u003c/strong\\u003e, \\u003cstrong\\u003eFalkor\\u003c/strong\\u003e, \\u003cstrong\\u003eNorbert\\u003c/strong\\u003e, \\u003cstrong\\u003eCharizard\\u003c/strong\\u003e, \\u003cstrong\\u003eSpyro\\u003c/strong\\u003e, \\u003cstrong\\u003eMushu\\u003c/strong\\u003e. Wizard \\u0026 Sorceress Names \\u003cstrong\\u003eGandalf\\u003c/strong\\u003e, \\u003cstrong\\u003eDumbledore\\u003c/strong\\u003e, \\u003cstrong\\u003eMerlin\\u003c/strong\\u003e, \\u003cstrong\\u003eMorgana\\u003c/strong\\u003e, \\u003cstrong\\u003eCirce\\u003c/strong\\u003e, \\u003cstrong\\u003eProspero\\u003c/strong\\u003e, \\u003cstrong\\u003eSabrina\\u003c/strong\\u003e, \\u003cstrong\\u003eGlinda\\u003c/strong\\u003e, \\u003cstrong\\u003eElphaba\\u003c/strong\\u003e. Elf \\u0026 Faerie Names \\u003cstrong\\u003eLegolas\\u003c/strong\\u003e, \\u003cstrong\\u003eGaladriel\\u003c/strong\\u003e, \\u003cstrong\\u003eElrond\\u003c/strong\\u003e, \\u003cstrong\\u003eArwen\\u003c/strong\\u003e, \\u003cstrong\\u003eTitania\\u003c/strong\\u003e, \\u003cstrong\\u003eOberon\\u003c/strong\\u003e, \\u003cstrong\\u003ePuck\\u003c/strong\\u003e, \\u003cstrong\\u003eTinkerbell\\u003c/strong\\u003e. Magical Realm \\u0026 Place Names \\u003cstrong\\u003eNarnia\\u003c/strong\\u003e, \\u003cstrong\\u003eHogwarts\\u003c/strong\\u003e, \\u003cstrong\\u003eValinor\\u003c/strong\\u003e, \\u003cstrong\\u003eAvalon\\u003c/strong\\u003e, \\u003cstrong\\u003eCamelot\\u003c/strong\\u003e, \\u003cstrong\\u003eAtlantis\\u003c/strong\\u003e, \\u003cstrong\\u003eNeverland\\u003c/strong\\u003e, \\u003cstrong\\u003eOz\\u003c/strong\\u003e. Mythical Creature Names Explore our name generators for {annas-hummingbird}, {archerfish}, {american-kestrel}, {african-slender-snouted-crocodile}, and {american-black-bear} to find the perfect name for your companion. \\u003cstrong\\u003ePhoenix\\u003c/strong\\u003e, \\u003cstrong\\u003eGriffin\\u003c/strong\\u003e, \\u003cstrong\\u003eUnicorn\\u003c/strong\\u003e, \\u003cstrong\\u003eBasilisk\\u003c/strong\\u003e, \\u003cstrong\\u003eHippogriff\\u003c/strong\\u003e, \\u003cstrong\\u003eKraken\\u003c/strong\\u003e, \\u003cstrong\\u003eLeviathan\\u003c/strong\\u003e, \\u003cstrong\\u003eChimera\\u003c/strong\\u003e.\\\",\\\"image\\\":\\\"https://bestanimalnames.com/images/og/blog-animal-names-inspired-by-fantasy.png\\\",\\\"inLanguage\\\":\\\"en\\\"}\"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"14:[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"script\\\",null,{\\\"type\\\":\\\"application/ld+json\\\",\\\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\\\":{\\\"__html\\\":\\\"$1d\\\"}}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"script\\\",null,{\\\"type\\\":\\\"application/ld+json\\\",\\\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\\\":{\\\"__html\\\":\\\"{\\\\\\\"@context\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"http