e Names Explore our name generators for {annas-hummingbird}, {archerfish}, {american-kestrel}, {african-slender-snouted-crocodile}, and {american-black-bear} to find the perfect name for your companion. <strong>Phoenix</strong>, <strong>Griffin</strong>, <strong>Unicorn</strong>, <strong>Basilisk</strong>, <strong>Hippogriff</strong>, <strong>Kraken</strong>, <strong>Leviathan</strong>, <strong>Chimera</strong>.\",\"image\":\"https://bestanimalnames.com/images/og/blog-animal-names-inspired-by-fantasy.png\",\"inLanguage\":\"en\"}0:{\"rsc\":[\"$\",\"$1\",\"c\",{\"children\":[[[\"$\",\"script\",null,{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$2\"}}],[\"$\",\"script\",null,{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"{\\\"@context\\\":\\\"https://schema.org\\\",\\\"@type\\\":\\\"FAQPage\\\",\\\"mainEntity\\\":[{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Question\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Are fantasy names only for fantasy fans?\\\",\\\"acceptedAnswer\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Answer\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"No — many fantasy names are now mainstream. Names like Luna, Arya, and Phoenix transcend their fictional origins.\\\"}},{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Question\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"What's the most popular fantasy pet name?\\\",\\\"acceptedAnswer\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Answer\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"Luna (Harry Potter), Loki (Marvel/Norse), and Phoenix are the most popular fantasy-inspired pet names.\\\"}}]}\"}}],[\"$\",\"script\",null,{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"{\\\"@context\\\":\\\"https://schema.org\\\",\\\"@type\\\":\\\"BreadcrumbList\\\",\\\"itemListElement\\\":[{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"ListItem\\\",\\\"position\\\":1,\\\"name\\\":\\\"Home\\\",\\\"item\\\":\\\"https://bestanimalnames.com/\\\"},{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"ListItem\\\",\\\"position\\\":2,\\\"name\\\":\\\"Blog\\\",\\\"item\\\":\\\"https://bestanimalnames.com/blog/\\\"},{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"ListItem\\\",\\\"position\\\":3,\\\"name\\\":\\\"Animal Names Inspi